     * Keys and values are upper-case, matching the casing the address is folded to before expansion.
     */
    private static final Map<String, String> ADDRESS_ABBREVIATIONS = Map.of(
        "ST", "STREET",
        "RD", "ROAD",
        "AVE", "AVENUE");

    /**
